          <li aria-current="page">Kishangarh Airport Taxi Guide</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Article Content -->
    <section class="article-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="article-layout">
          <article class="article-body">
            
            <div class="toc-box">
              <h2 class="toc-title">Airport Guide Sections</h2>
              <ol class="toc-list">
                <li><a href="#about-airport">1. About Kishangarh Airport (KQH) &amp; Operating Airlines</a></li>
                <li><a href="#distance-travel-time">2. Distance &amp; Driving Times to Ajmer and Pushkar</a></li>
                <li><a href="#fare-chart-kqh">3. 2026 Fixed Taxi Fares from Kishangarh Airport</a></li>
                <li><a href="#dumping-yard">4. Popular En-Route Tour: The Kishangarh Marble Dumping Yard</a></li>
                <li><a href="#why-prebook">5. Why On-Spot Taxis Are Scarce at KQH</a></li>
                <li><a href="#flight-tracking">6. Flight Tracking &amp; Chauffeur Meet-and-Greet</a></li>
                <li><a href="#faqs">7. Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</a></li>
              </ol>
            </div>

            <h2 id="about-airport">1. About Kishangarh Airport (KQH) &amp; Operating Airlines</h2>
            <p>
              Inaugurated to boost pilgrimage connectivity, <strong>Kishangarh Airport</strong> is located on NH 48 just outside the marble city of Kishangarh. The airport connects the Ajmer–Pushkar region directly with major metros including Delhi (Indira Gandhi International Airport), Ahmedabad, Hyderabad, Lucknow, and Mumbai via regional carriers such as Star Air and Alliance Air.
            </p>
            <p>
              Because it is a regional airport, passenger volume arrives in batches around scheduled flight landings. Within 20 minutes of landing, dozens of passengers exit the single terminal simultaneously, creating sudden surges in local taxi demand.
            </p>

            <h2 id="distance-travel-time">2. Distance &amp; Driving Times to Ajmer and Pushkar</h2>
            <p>
              Depending on your final hotel or residence, here is the realistic driving duration via NH 48:
            </p>
            <div class="info-card">
              <h4>📍 Airport Travel Breakdown:</h4>
              <ul>
                <li>• <strong>Kishangarh Airport &rarr; Ajmer City Center / Dargah:</strong> 28 KM · 35 to 45 mins via NH 48</li>
                <li>• <strong>Kishangarh Airport &rarr; Pushkar Holy Town:</strong> 42 KM · 50 to 65 mins via Ajmer Bypass &amp; Nag Pahar</li>
                <li>• <strong>Kishangarh Airport &rarr; Sarwar Sharif:</strong> 85 KM · 1 hr 45 mins via Nasirabad Highway</li>
                <li>• <strong>Kishangarh Airport &rarr; Jaipur:</strong> 105 KM · 1 hr 45 mins via NH 48 Expressway</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <h2 id="fare-chart-kqh">3. 2026 Fixed Taxi Fares from Kishangarh Airport</h2>
            <p>
              We provide fixed, transparent operator pricing with commercial permits, clean AC vehicles, and complimentary flight delay tracking:
            </p>

            <div class="table-wrap">
              <table class="blog-table">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Destination From Kishangarh Airport (KQH)</th>
                    <th>Distance</th>
                    <th>Dzire / Etios</th>
                    <th>Ertiga (6-Seater)</th>
                    <th>Innova Crysta</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>Ajmer City / Railway Station / Dargah Drop</strong></td>
                    <td>28 km</td>
                    <td class="price-val">₹900</td>
                    <td class="price-val">₹1,400</td>
                    <td class="price-val">₹1,800</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>Pushkar Resorts / Brahma Temple / Ghats</strong></td>
                    <td>42 km</td>
                    <td class="price-val">₹1,400</td>
                    <td class="price-val">₹2,000</td>
                    <td class="price-val">₹2,600</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>Ajmer Drop + Marble Dumping Yard Stop</strong></td>
                    <td>38 km</td>
                    <td class="price-val">₹1,200</td>
                    <td class="price-val">₹1,700</td>
                    <td class="price-val">₹2,200</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>Pushkar Drop + Marble Dumping Yard Stop</strong></td>
                    <td>52 km</td>
                    <td class="price-val">₹1,700</td>
                    <td class="price-val">₹2,400</td>
                    <td class="price-val">₹3,000</td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>

            <div class="cta-inline">
