                <p>Share your flight number for guaranteed tarmac-to-hotel chauffeur pickup.</p>
              </div>
              <a href={waAirport} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--gold">Book Airport Cab &rarr;</a>
            </div>

            <h2 id="dumping-yard">4. Popular En-Route Tour: The Kishangarh Marble Dumping Yard</h2>
            <p>
              The world-famous <strong>Kishangarh Marble Slurry Dumping Yard</strong> is located just 12 km from Kishangarh Airport. Often hailed as the <em>"Mines of Snow"</em> or <em>"White Switzerland of Rajasthan,"</em> this massive expanse of crystalline white marble slurry has been featured in blockbuster Bollywood movies and viral wedding shoots.
            </p>
            <p>
              When booking our airport transfer, you can opt for the <strong>Dumping Yard En-Route Package</strong>:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Our driver picks you up from the airport and takes you directly to the Kishangarh Marble Association office for mandatory security gate pass clearance.</li>
              <li>You spend 45 to 60 minutes taking photographs against the turquoise artificial lakes and white slurry dunes.</li>
              <li>Your luggage remains safe inside the locked, air-conditioned cab trunk under chauffeur supervision.</li>
              <li>You continue onward to your hotel in Ajmer or Pushkar refreshed.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 id="why-prebook">5. Why On-Spot Taxis Are Scarce at KQH</h2>
            <p>
              Unlike mega-airports in Delhi or Mumbai, Kishangarh Airport does not have hundreds of app cabs like Uber or Ola queued up outside. Local aggregators often cancel rides or show "No Cabs Available" because drivers are unwilling to drive out 10 km empty from the city center.
            </p>
            <p>
              Unscheduled travelers stepping out of the terminal frequently find themselves surrounded by private freelance operators demanding ₹1,800 to ₹2,500 for a basic sedan drop. <strong>Pre-booking your ride guarantees your vehicle and locks in your fair direct rate.</strong>
            </p>

            <h2 id="flight-tracking">6. Flight Tracking &amp; Chauffeur Meet-and-Greet</h2>
            <p>
              Regional flights can occasionally encounter airspace delays or weather diversions. When you book with Taxi Services in Ajmer:
            </p>
            <ol class="styled-list">
              <li>You simply provide your <strong>Flight Number (e.g., S5 212 / 9I 843)</strong> when booking on WhatsApp.</li>
              <li>Our dispatch team monitors live FlightRadar status.</li>
              <li>Even if your flight touches down 90 minutes behind schedule, your driver will be waiting patiently at the Terminal Exit with your name placard.</li>
              <li>Zero extra waiting fee is charged for airline delays.</li>
            </ol>

            <h2 id="faqs">7. Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>
            <div class="faq-accordion">
              <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>What is the taxi fare from Kishangarh Airport to Pushkar?</h3>
                <p>The direct AC Sedan taxi fare from Kishangarh Airport to any hotel, tent camp, or resort in Pushkar is ₹1,400. For a larger 6-seater Ertiga (ideal for families with 3-4 bags), the fare is ₹2,000.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Are pre-paid taxi booths available inside Kishangarh Airport?</h3>
                <p>Kishangarh Airport does not have a formal pre-paid police booth. Most travelers pre-book with reputable local fleet operators like Taxi Services in Ajmer to ensure fixed pricing and avoid on-spot bargaining.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Is an entry permit needed for the Kishangarh Marble Dumping Yard?</h3>
                <p>Yes, a complimentary security pass must be stamped at the Kishangarh Marble Association gate. Our chauffeurs assist you with the permit process so you enter without any delay.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

          </article>

